# Sample solutions of the practicals: they live in the private repository sds210-solutions.
# The release workflow adds each one here after its deadline (git add -f); see
# .github/RELEASING-SOLUTIONS.md. Once released, a file is tracked and this rule no longer applies.
book/*/*_practical*solution*.ipynb
book/*/*_practical*solution*.md
